ut that program needs to call `env.DeployRickCustomizations()` which reads `workspace.GetRickDir()` to find `.rick/skills`. Wait — `DeployRickCustomizations()` calls `workspace.GetRickDir()` which locates the rick dir based on cwd (the repo root). Then it calls `deployRickCustomizations(filepath.Join(rickDir, \"skills\"))`. But the agent deployment needs the source wiki content from `internal/prompt/templates/skills/think.md` (embedded templates), not from `.rick/skills`.\n\nHmm wait. Let me re-read the task goal: \"system prompt = 对应源码 skill 的 wiki 内容\". And the key result 1 says \"internal/env（职责 3）产出 3 个 agent 的 frontmatter + system prompt 内容\". So the agent content (system prompt = wiki content) comes from the embedded templates in `internal/prompt/templates/skills/`. \n\nSo the implementation will likely read the embedded skill content (via `internal/prompt`'s embedded templates, or embed its own copy) and write agent files to `AgentDir()/agents/`.\n\nLet me check how templates are embedded in internal/prompt."}}
